<form class="soul-burn-sound-form">
  <nav class="soul-burn-settings-tabs tabs" data-group="primary">
    <a class="item" data-tab="sounds"><i class="fas fa-volume-high"></i> Sounds</a>
    <a class="item" data-tab="visuals"><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Visuals</a>
    <a class="item" data-tab="mechanics"><i class="fas fa-gears"></i> Mechanics</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="soul-burn-settings-body">
    <div class="tab" data-group="primary" data-tab="sounds">
      <p class="notes">
        Choose audio from Foundry's file browser. Preview plays only for you;
        in-game sounds are shared with connected players.
      </p>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Soul Burn Power-Up</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="text" name="powerUpSound" value="{{powerUpSound}}">
          <button type="button" data-browse-target="powerUpSound" title="Browse"><i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i></button>
          <button type="button" data-preview-target="powerUpSound" title="Preview"><i class="fas fa-play"></i></button>
          <button type="button" data-default-target="powerUpSound" title="Restore bundled sound"><i class="fas fa-rotate-left"></i></button>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Played when Soul Burn activates.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Soul Burn Ending / Transform Back</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="text" name="endSound" value="{{endSound}}" placeholder="Choose an audio file">
          <button type="button" data-browse-target="endSound" title="Browse"><i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i></button>
          <button type="button" data-preview-target="endSound" title="Preview"><i class="fas fa-play"></i></button>
          <button type="button" data-default-target="endSound" title="Restore bundled sound"><i class="fas fa-rotate-left"></i></button>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Played when the duration expires or Soul Burn ends early. Bundled default: RagePowerDown.ogg.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>AetherGlow Drinking</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="text" name="aetherglowSound" value="{{aetherglowSound}}">
          <button type="button" data-browse-target="aetherglowSound" title="Browse"><i class="fas fa-folder-open"></i></button>
          <button type="button" data-preview-target="aetherglowSound" title="Preview"><i class="fas fa-play"></i></button>
          <button type="button" data-default-target="aetherglowSound" title="Restore bundled sound"><i class="fas fa-rotate-left"></i></button>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Played when AetherGlow is consumed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tab" data-group="primary" data-tab="visuals">
      <h2>Battlefield Ripple</h2>
      <p class="notes">
        The base grayscale cue occurs three seconds earlier than the original
        animation endpoint. After the configured Delay elapses, a live
        refractive wave expands from the transformed character.
        Every connected client resolves the origin from that token using its
        own camera position and zoom. The grayscale layer uses the transformed
        token's transparency as a live cutout, leaving the real canvas token
        and its TokenMagic animation in full color without a rectangular copy
        or synthetic glow.
      </p>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Delay</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="number" name="rippleDelaySeconds" value="{{rippleDelaySeconds}}" min="0" max="30" step="0.1">
          <span class="units">seconds</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Additional time after the early ripple cue. Default: 1 second; set to 0 for the earliest playback.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Contrast Increase</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="number" name="rippleContrast" value="{{rippleContrast}}" min="0" max="200" step="1">
          <span class="units">%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Additional contrast after the ripple passes. Default: 10%.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Desaturation</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="number" name="rippleDesaturation" value="{{rippleDesaturation}}" min="0" max="100" step="1">
          <span class="units">%</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Amount of battlefield color removed. 100% is fully desaturated.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Return to Normal</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="number" name="rippleRecoverySeconds" value="{{rippleRecoverySeconds}}" min="1" max="600" step="1">
          <span class="units">seconds</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Real time taken for contrast and color to return to normal. Default: 60 seconds.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tab" data-group="primary" data-tab="mechanics">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>High Stakes Mode</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="highStakesMode" {{checked highStakesMode}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          Multiplies the activation roll by lifetime Uses: first use 1 die,
          second use 2 dice, third use 3 dice, and so on. The total adds Soul
          Burn; the first die determines the duration.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>AetherGlow Reduces Soul Burn Die</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="aetherglowReducesSoulBurnDie" {{checked aetherglowReducesSoulBurnDie}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          Optional High-Stakes rule. Each AetherGlow exposure lowers that
          recipient's future Soul Burn activation progression by one die, to a
          minimum of one. It never restores, removes, or stops Lifetime Uses;
          Uses continue increasing normally on later activations. Disabled by
          default.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Show AGT in Inventory Bar</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="showAGTInInventoryBar" {{checked showAGTInInventoryBar}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          Shows the active character's AGT and Player Uses information shortcut
          in the Soul Burn Inventory heading.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Show Rounds Remaining in Inventory Bar</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="showRoundsInInventoryBar" {{checked showRoundsInInventoryBar}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          Shows combat rounds remaining, or the manual duration, in the Soul
          Burn Inventory heading.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Constitution Save on End</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="requireEndConSave" {{checked requireEndConSave}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Post a chat request for the owning player to roll a Constitution saving throw whenever Soul Burn ends.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Apply Exhaustion on Failed Save</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="applyExhaustionOnFailedConCheck" {{checked applyExhaustionOnFailedConCheck}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          Adds one exhaustion level after a failed save. Enabling this option
          also enables Constitution Save on End.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Constitution Save DC</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="number" name="endConSaveDC" value="{{endConSaveDC}}" min="1" max="30" step="1">
        </div>
        <p class="hint">The target number for the end-of-burn check.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Escalating Constitution Save DC</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="escalatingEndConSaveDC" {{checked escalatingEndConSaveDC}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          Starts at the Constitution Save DC above on the first lifetime Soul
          Burn use, then increases by 2 for each later use. A failed escalating
          check automatically adds one level of exhaustion. Enabling this also
          enables Constitution Save on End and exhaustion on failure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Automatically End Soul Burn on Fate Shift</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="checkbox" name="autoEndOnFateShift" {{checked autoEndOnFateShift}}>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">
          When enabled, Soul Burn ends only after the Fate Shift countdown
          reaches zero. Disabled by default; when disabled, Fate Shift leaves
          the character in Soul Burn.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Fate Shift Countdown</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
          <input type="number" name="fateShiftTimerSeconds" value="{{fateShiftTimerSeconds}}" min="1" max="600" step="1">
          <span class="units">seconds</span>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Real time given to the player to describe how they bend reality.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group stacked">
        <label>Fate Shift Message</label>
        <textarea name="fateShiftTimerMessage" rows="3">{{fateShiftTimerMessage}}</textarea>
        <p class="hint">Use <code>{seconds}</code> where the live number of remaining seconds should appear.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="sheet-footer flexrow">
    <button type="submit" name="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save</button>
  </footer>
</form>
